        "english": "law",
        "emoji": "📜",
        "hindi": "कानून",
        "hinglish": "kaanoon"
      },
      "meaning": "a rule made by the government",
      "example": "Wearing a helmet is the law.",
      "exampleMeaning": {
        "hi": "हेलमेट पहनना कानून है।",
        "hinglish": "Helmet pehenna kaanoon hai."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "learn_word",
