        "hindi": "अधिकार",
        "hinglish": "adhikaar"
      },
      "meaning": "things every person is allowed to have or do",
      "example": "Every child has rights to food, school and safety.",
      "exampleMeaning": {
        "hi": "हर बच्चे को खाना, पढ़ाई और सुरक्षा का अधिकार है।",
        "hinglish": "Har bachche ko khaana, padhaai aur suraksha ka adhikaar hai."
      }
    },
